  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We will build the system to your specification, or you can choose from our standard modular wayfinding systems. Another option is a system of small totems and signposts.",
   "anchor": "orientacni-systemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Graphics: a clear graphic solution in illuminated and non-illuminated versions, matched to the space and to your brand identity.",
   "anchor": "orientacni-systemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Installation: on the wall, on spacers, on suspension cables, on free-standing structures, or as totems and signposts.",
   "anchor": "orientacni-systemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Placement: indoors, outdoors, in buildings and across large sites — for example logistics parks, hospitals or department stores.",
   "anchor": "orientacni-systemy"
  },
