  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Wayfinding systems to suit the space and the need",
   "anchor": "orientacni-systemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We design indoor, outdoor and modular wayfinding systems so that they adapt easily to a particular place and to individual requirements.",
   "anchor": "orientacni-systemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "What is a wayfinding system for?",
   "anchor": "orientacni-systemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "It is a set of information boards, direction signs and labels that makes it easier for people to get around. It helps visitors quickly grasp how the space is laid out and find the right way without having to ask staff.",
   "anchor": "orientacni-systemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "What are wayfinding systems made of?",
   "anchor": "orientacni-systemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "From sheet material in aluminium, Dibond or acrylic. A popular material with a strikingly attractive look is anodized aluminium. Other materials can be used as well — wood, stainless steel, acrylic glass.",
   "anchor": "orientacni-systemy"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "How is illuminated advertising made?",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "The first step is yours – we’ll take care of everything else.",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request a no-obligation quote",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "We receive your enquiry",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "By phone: +420 491 482 500 (Mon–Fri 6:00–15:00)",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "By email: eldr@eldr.cz",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Via contact form",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Within 2 business days: We send a price estimate",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "We’ll send a price estimate based on similar completed projects, including reference photos.",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "We’ll ask about key details (size, placement, graphics, background surface, material, interest in design creation).",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Immediately afterwards: We provide a tailored final offer",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "We prepare the quote completely free of charge.",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "The offer includes installation and transport.",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "The offer can be modified as needed.",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Within 4–8 weeks: We install",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "We arrive at the agreed location and install the signage.",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "We connect the signage to the power supply.",
   "anchor": "jak-probiha-vyroba"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Trusted by leading Czech and international companies",
   "anchor": "duvera"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Rely on proven quality and join those who already trust us. We will get back to you no later than the next business day.",
   "anchor": "duvera"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request a no-obligation quote",
   "anchor": "duvera"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "All references",
   "anchor": "duvera"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Why you should choose our illuminated advertising",
   "anchor": "zaruka-kvality"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The longest-running illuminated advertising manufacturer in the Czech Republic.",
   "anchor": "zaruka-kvality"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "High-quality materials and energy-efficient LEDs that will shine brightly for years to come.",
   "anchor": "zaruka-kvality"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Our illuminated advertising is made entirely in the Czech Republic.",
   "anchor": "zaruka-kvality"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We provide professional installation and maintenance services.",
   "anchor": "zaruka-kvality"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We design illuminated advertising tailored to your brand identity.",
